1. She has a disrupted sleeping pattern and struggles with staying on a regular sleep schedule. (Verbatim: "Don't worry though, that tweet I made at 4.20am was scheduled... 2am me really, really, really doesn't function.")
2. She experiences anxiety, especially when organizing events, fearing that no one will attend. (Verbatim: "It's like the fear when you want to like organize a birthday party and nobody turns up... that was my worry.")
