5. She used After Effects to create stream elements and also designed her own logo. (Verbatim: "it was fun using After Effects... I made the logo as well.")
6. She finds it difficult to trust her late-night self when planning or scheduling tasks. (Verbatim: "I should not trust 2am me. 2am me really, really, really doesn't function.")
7. She suffers from migraines, which can affect her stream audio levels. (Verbatim: "Sorry, I just realized my migraines, probably it's a bit on the quiet side, let's turn that up.")
8. She values inclusivity between indie and corporate VTubers and sees herself as a bridge between the two. (Verbatim: "vitere is kind of the bridge between indie and corpo right... i think that's a really cool thing to have in the vtubing space.")
9. She previously felt shy about reaching out to corporate VTubers and understands similar feelings in others. (Verbatim: "i feel like a lot of indies probably feel a bit too shy you know to to communicate with with corpo vtubers.")
10. She is deeply appreciative of kindness and is saddened when kind people are mistreated for associating with her. (Verbatim: "it just makes me sad that people would be mean to such kind people just for being kind.") [end of text]



1. She is a celestial messenger and not a goose, despite having wings. (Verbatim: "these are celestial messenger wings i am a celestial messenger not a goose not a goose not a goose")

