7. She identifies as awkward in social situations, especially with strangers approaching her. (Verbatim: "i'm awkward enough with just random people talking to me and i'll be like i don't know you.")

8. She humorously describes herself as a "feral nerd" who lives in the wild, indicating a self-image of social reclusiveness. (Verbatim: "what is social what is the internet i don't know what the internet is i live in the wild runs back to the forest see ya like some feral nerd.")

9. Her VTuber outfit was designed to be wearable in real life, consisting of a shirt with a bow, coat, skirt, and large wings. (Verbatim: "this outfit was slightly designed with the idea of something i would actually like to wear like normally... although my outfit's pretty like normal.")

10. She finds the idea of someone cosplaying her both awkward and flattering, though notes the wings would make it difficult. (Verbatim: "if anyone does cosplay me that would be quite the dream... the wings would be hard though... big wings are difficult lemon difficult.") [end of text]



